  "instructions": [
    "heat the olive oil in a large pan over medium heat.",
    "add the onion and garlic and cook until softened, about 5 minutes.",
    "add the fennel sausages and cook until browned, about 3-4 minutes.",
    "add the arborio rice and cook for 1-2 minutes, until lightly toasted.",
    "add the white wine and cook until the liquid is almost completely absorbed.",
    "add 250ml of the chicken broth and cook until largely absorbed, stirring constantly.",
    "repeat this process, adding the remaining broth in 250ml increments, until the rice is cooked and creamy.",
    "stir in the grated parmesan, fresh parsley, salt, black pepper, fennel seeds, ground cumin, lemon juice, and crushed red pepper.",
    "add the unsalted butter and stir until melted.",
    "season with additional salt and pepper if needed.",
    "serve immediately and enjoy!",
    "Ensure poultry is cooked to an internal temperature of 74°C / 165°F (juices run clear, no pink remaining) before serving."
  ],
